  "notes": [
    "This manifest is the route-to-schema source of truth for the 32 locale-scoped App Router page patterns currently present under src/app/[lang].",
    "The 32 entries are source route patterns, not a count of concrete URLs. Dynamic route parameters and the active locale list returned by the API expand the runtime URL set.",
    "Schema IDs identify the templates intended for each route. A route is migrated only when its page renders the central JsonLdScript component; pending routes remain part of the migration inventory.",
    "The first URL segment is the locale and is resolved dynamically; no active locale list is hardcoded in this manifest.",
    "Admin and personal citizen workspace routes are marked non-indexable as a conservative default; revisit these flags if product access and indexing policy changes."
